      "html": "<hr/>\n<div style=\"font-size: smaller; float: left; padding-right: 10px\">\n<a class=\"basic\" href=\"/VT/Burlington/#!/Burlington03/Burlington03.html#wwfootnote_inline_55\" name=\"55\" rel=\"cgi/extract.pl?page=html/Burlington03/Burlington03.html&amp;anchor=wwfootnote_inline_55\">1</a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"Footnote\"><span class=\"bold\">Charter reference—</span>Authority of city council to acquire and regulate a municipal airport, § <a class=\"basic\" href=\"/VT/Burlington/#!/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH03.html#48\" rel=\"cgi/extract.pl?page=html/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH03.html&amp;anchor=48\">48</a>(L); board of aircraft commissioners authorized, § <a class=\"basic\" href=\"/VT/Burlington/#!/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH05.html#120\" rel=\"cgi/extract.pl?page=html/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH05.html&amp;anchor=120\">120</a>; powers and duties of commission, § <a class=\"basic\" href=\"/VT/Burlington/#!/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH06.html#276\" rel=\"cgi/extract.pl?page=html/BurlingtonCH/BurlingtonCH06.html&amp;anchor=276\">276</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"Footnote\"><span class=\"bold\">Cross reference—</span>Licenses generally, Ch. <a class=\"basic\" href=\"/VT/Burlington/#!/Burlington19/Burlington19.html#19\" rel=\"cgi/extract.pl?page=html/Burlington19/Burlington19.html&amp;anchor=19\">19</a>; zoning, App. A.</p>\n<p class=\"Footnote\"><span class=\"bold\">State law reference—</span>Regulation of operation of aircraft, <a href=\"http://legislature.vermont.gov/statutes/title/05\" target=\"_blank\">5</a> V.S.A. § 141 et seq.; airports generally, <a href=\"http://legislature.vermont.gov/statutes/title/05\" target=\"_blank\">5</a> V.S.A. § 291 et seq.; airport zoning, <a href=\"http://legislature.vermont.gov/statutes/title/05\" target=\"_blank\">5</a> V.S.A. § 551 et seq.</p>\n<br/>",
